-     - `vY1Z0 = lerp(vX0Y1Z0, vX1Y1Z0, mixX.z)` [S1, unofficial]
-   - For the second Z-slice (`mixZ.y`):
-     - `vY0Z1 = lerp(vX0Y0Z1, vX1Y0Z1, mixX.z)` [S1, unofficial]
-     - `vY1Z1 = lerp(vX0Y1Z1, vX1Y1Z1, mixX.z)` [S1, unofficial]
